<title>USA: U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soyoil weekly export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Sales of 41,600 MT were primarily the result of increases for China (32,000 MT), unknown destinations (7,000 MT), and Hong Kong (2,000 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 7,800 MT were to Mexico (3,300 MT), Hong Kong (2,000 MT), Ecuador (1,900 MT), and the Dominican Republic (700 MT).</p>
</text>
